    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/translation-service/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Translation Service theme is expertly designed for a range of professionals, including businesses, agencies, freelancers, translators, interpreters, language schools, linguists, content writers, and localization experts. It provides a robust platform for creating a professional multilingual website that enhances international presence and supports ecommerce functionality for selling translation packages, language courses, digital content, and localization services through WooCommerce. This makes it perfect for establishing online stores, dropshipping, and print-on-demand products related to language learning. The theme boasts seamless multilingual compatibility and Polylang integration, enabling precise translation of pages, posts, menus, and widgets, with options for both automated and professional translations to facilitate global communication and cultural localization. Fully responsive, fast-loading, and optimized for search engines with Yoast SEO, it includes features like Contact Form 7 for inquiries, customizable layouts, intuitive navigation, and high performance across all devices. Ideal for corporate translation companies, ecommerce stores wanting localization, creative portfolios, blogs, and international service-based businesses, this comprehensive solution significantly boosts digital reach, builds trust, and enhances customer engagement worldwide. Check out the demo at: https://www.vwthemes.net/translation-service-pro/. Demo:https://www.vwthemes.net/translation-service-pro/"
    },
